# Review is required on everything, and named explicitly on the paths where a malicious change would
# be worth the most to an attacker: anything that runs in CI holding our token, anything that ships
# to a user's machine, and the release plumbing itself.
#
# Owners must be users or teams with write access. An owner that does not exist makes the whole file
# inert without failing anything, so change these only to an account or team that really has access.
*                       @cchacons

/.github/               @cchacons
/scripts/               @cchacons
/package.json           @cchacons
/package-lock.json      @cchacons
/server.json            @cchacons
/.claude-plugin/        @cchacons
/plugins/               @cchacons
